      "writtenOn": "2020-11-02T23:27:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will we hit this clause?  On my own systems with no battery, we generally go into Unattached.SNK above, and transition into Atatched.SNK per usual (with no Try.SRC)\n\nThe brown outs occur later at the PE layer, when we hard reset looking for source caps.",
