      "writtenOn": "2020-11-03T15:47:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Will we hit this clause?  \n\nI think so. What do you see instead (if you run flashrom without battery)?\n\n\u003e The brown outs occur later at the PE layer, when we hard reset looking for source caps.\n\nYes, the intention is to skip waiting for source caps by starting from ATTACHED_SNK.",
      "parentUuid": "7ea0e047_00b57720",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1438,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 1438,
